msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "导读"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:3 f1b56064fd434857978234f13d31ef51
msgid ""
"This section introduces the FiveAges Sim ecosystem — what it is, how its "
"components fit together, and how to navigate the documentation."
msgstr "本节介绍 FiveAges Sim 生态系统——它是什么、各组件如何协同，以及如何浏览文档。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:5 c48168384d0d4833af471193c516758f
msgid "What is FiveAges Sim?"
msgstr "什么是 FiveAges Sim？"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:7 c38e3002a4534a47bbf8d75c5bd77814
msgid "FiveAges Sim is a collection of ROS 2 packages and workspaces that enable:"
msgstr "FiveAges Sim 是一组 ROS 2 软件包与工作空间，可用于："

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:9 ae9f6f0822e04e36a07add6a3fcf347b
msgid "**Robot Description** — URDF/xacro models with ros2_control integration"
msgstr "**机器人描述** — 集成 ros2_control 的 URDF/xacro 模型"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:10 b65ef888b94e4b8b88b3903510340c05
msgid "**Hardware Control** — 硬件接口 plugins for real robot hardware (驱动层 / 硬件驱动)"
msgstr "**硬件控制** — 对接真机的**硬件接口**插件（驱动层 / 硬件驱动）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:11 2b8d2a801d984e4eb3cc1f8aa5c11a6e
msgid "**MPC Controllers** — OCS2-based motion planning and control (分体控制 / 全身控制)"
msgstr "**MPC 控制器** — 基于 OCS2 的运动规划与控制（分体控制 / 全身控制）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:12 64edfd13e98c4709ae1458561ac38907
msgid ""
"**Simulation** — Gazebo Harmonic, and **FaSim** (Isaac Sim high-fidelity "
"+ the same ROS 2 运控 as the real robot, plus simulation ground truth)"
msgstr ""
"**仿真** — Gazebo Harmonic，以及 **FaSim**（Isaac Sim 高保真 + 与真机同一套 ROS 2 "
"运控，外加仿真真值）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:13 48a7095d49ec409ea3018a143859fee7
msgid "**Teleoperation** — VR, isomorphic teleop, and glove-based control"
msgstr "**遥操作** — VR、同构遥操作以及基于手套的控制"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:14 48c2b7c727674a5581432a5c49256be3
msgid ""
"**Python Applications** — High-level APIs for data collection and "
"autonomous tasks"
msgstr "**Python 应用** — 用于数据采集与自主任务的高层 API"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:15 7dc12cd1ac304c749c19a3a989c1e1bb
msgid ""
"**Synthetic data** — Isaac Sim USD → interface → composer → LeRobot "
"record/export ([Synthetic Data](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md))"
msgstr ""
"**合成数据** — Isaac Sim USD → 接口 → composer → LeRobot "
"录制/导出（[合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:17 739a81e50df947b1b2fe13a24f42359c
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "术语"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:20 e56f0e4de31c4026844a1fc60b45a834
msgid ""
"In this documentation, **humanoid** means a **wheeled-arm humanoid** "
"(mobile base + arms, e.g. FiveAges W2/W2R). It does **not** mean a "
"bipedal or footed humanoid."
msgstr ""
"在本文档中，**humanoid / 人形机器人** 指 **轮臂人形**（移动底盘 + 双臂，例如 FiveAges "
"W2/W2R），**不是** 双足或足式人形。"

