#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:37 445401b71ff84f40beeaed4c595ce7ef
msgid ""
"**ARX Lift 2S** (full-body mobile manipulator, including chassis) and "
"**HighTorque Panthera HT** (dual-arm manipulator) have dedicated `open-"
"deploy-ws` branches. **Acone** / **AC One** is **dual-arm**, not the Lift"
" 2S platform. See [ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) and "
"[HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限 Lift 2S**（全身移动操作臂，含底盘）和 **高擎 Panthera HT**（双臂操作臂）有独立的 `open-"
"deploy-ws` 分支。**Acone** / **AC One** 是 **双臂**，不是 Lift 2S 整机。见 [方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) 与 [高擎 "
"Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。"

